  "basis": "All51 frozen runtime obligations mapped; N34 remains external only. Ten separately declared supplements read in full. No production source authored/changed or product/target execution performed by reviewer.",
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "status": "resolved",
      "scope": "New path-generated error controls",
      "finding": "assert_details returns silently when stage differs/missing. Most mapped controls also accept any legal rule_id instead of the required mapped rule.",
      "required": "Require closed details and stage=rtld_paths for expected new path errors; bind exact mapped rule/category/reason where the adopted schema/crosswalk specifies it. Preserve legacy/callback wrapper distinctions.",
      "resolved_in": "ADAPTER-004; retained in005"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "status": "resolved",
      "scope": "P01/P03/P04",
      "finding": "P03 asserts result witness but no frozen /lib symlink observation order; P01/P04 count opens of /usr without proving the admitted physical .. transition from held /usr/lib64.",
      "required": "Retain input basename and held-parent identity/path in synthetic trace. Assert expected link sequence and explicit parent-pop at each relevant fresh-root pass.",
      "resolved_in": "ADAPTER-004; retained in005"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "status": "resolved",
      "scope": "F05/F06/F07/F12",
      "finding": "Distinct tuples anywhere do not prove retained before/after identities for the declared replaced entry. F12 checks labels/binding presence without exact changed tuple.",
      "required": "Assert fault-specific same-path expected and observed identities and completed binding details as specified by each immutable event.",
      "resolved_in": "ADAPTER-004; retained in005"
    }
  ],
  "supplemental_review": "S01\u2013S10 additions exercise concrete adopted contract risks without changing 51 frozen controls. No additional mandatory finding found in these additions.",
